=========================================
OBJECTIVE
=========================================

Build all reusable components that will support the Payment Service.

No business transactions should occur here.

=========================================
IMPORTANT CHANGE
=========================================

Update PaymentEntity by adding:

private Boolean fullyAllocated = false;

Business Rules

fullyAllocated = true

when

allocatedAmount equals amountReceived

Otherwise

fullyAllocated = false

This value will be maintained by the PaymentCalculationUtil and PaymentAllocationService.

=========================================
RECEIPT NUMBER GENERATOR
=========================================

Create

ReceiptNumberGenerator

Generate receipt numbers using the enterprise format already used in the Invoice module.

Example

RCP-202607-000001

Requirements

• Thread-safe
• Uses existing numbering configuration if available
• No duplicate numbers
• Reusable service/component

=========================================
PAYMENT MAPPER
=========================================

Create PaymentMapper.

Include methods for mapping between

CreatePaymentRequest

PaymentEntity

PaymentDetailsResponse

PaymentListItemResponse

CreatePaymentResponse

UpdateDraftPaymentRequest

RefundPaymentRequest

Do not implement business logic inside the mapper.

=========================================
PAYMENT VALIDATOR
=========================================

Create PaymentValidator.

Include reusable validation methods.

Examples

validateCustomerExists()

validateInvoicesBelongToCustomer()

validateBankAccount()

validatePositiveAmount()

validateCurrency()

validateExchangeRate()

validatePaymentStatus()

validateDraftPayment()

validateReceiptNumber()

validateRefund()

Throw the project's existing BusinessException or ValidationException.

Do not return booleans.

=========================================
PAYMENT CALCULATION UTIL
=========================================

Create PaymentCalculationUtil.

Responsibilities

calculateAllocatedAmount()

calculateUnallocatedAmount()

calculateCustomerCredit()

isFullyAllocated()

updateAllocationTotals()

calculateRemainingBalance()

updateInvoiceOutstanding()

Business Rule

allocatedAmount =
sum(all allocations)

unallocatedAmount =
amountReceived - allocatedAmount

fullyAllocated =
allocatedAmount.compareTo(amountReceived) == 0

All monetary calculations must use BigDecimal.

Never use double or float.

